# Ansible - Create Docker Containers for Multiple Applications

```yaml
 - name: Setup Docker Container For Multiple Apps
  hosts: all
  become: yes
 
tasks: 
	- name: Pull Web App Image
	 docker_image:
	  name: Neeraj-web-app
	  source: pull
	
	- name: Pull Database App Image
	  docker_image:
	  name: Neeraj-database-app
	  source: pull

	- name: Run Web App Container
	  docker_container:
		name: Neeraj-web-app
		image: Neeraj-web-app
		state: started
		published_ports:
		- "8080:80"

	- name: Run Database App Container
            docker_container:
		name: database-app
		image: Neeraj-database-app
		state: started
		published_ports:
		- "3306:3306"

